          <desc>
            Designated initialiser including the mate
            extension fields (
            <code><var>matePosition</var></code> +
            <code><var>templateLength</var></code>). Older
            initialisers delegate here with
            <code><var>matePosition</var> = -1</code>,
            <code><var>templateLength</var> = 0</code>.
          </desc>
